# Open Road Rag: the first driving tune. A clarinet over a tuba's oom and the piano's pah, brushes on the
# drums; ragtime's two strains, A A' B A' (32 bars, C major then F), straight eighths.
title Open Road Rag
tempo 132
meter 4/4
swing 0

