| f#5/8 a5/8 d6/4 c6/8 a5/8 f#5/4 | a5/4 f#5/4 d5/4 f#5/4 | g5/8 a5/8 b5/4 d6/4 b5/4 | a5/4 g5/4 f5/4 d5/4 |
